---
---

<section class="w-full py-space-3xl lg:py-space-4xl bg-surface-container-low/60" id="sobre-mi">
  <div class="max-w-max-width-content mx-auto px-gutter-mobile lg:px-gutter-desktop">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-xl lg:gap-space-2xl items-center">
      <!-- Columna izquierda -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col items-start gap-space-md">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-space-md py-1 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm">
          Mi vocación
        </span>

        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile lg:text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight">
          Enseñar desde la empatía y la curiosidad natural.
        </h2>

        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Soy licenciada en Pedagogía con más de una década dedicada al refuerzo escolar individualizado y el desbloqueo académico. A menudo, el problema no es la capacidad del estudiante, sino la presión acumulada y métodos que no encajan con su ritmo cognitivo.
        </p>

        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Diseño rutas de aprendizaje adaptativas donde desarmamos la frustración paso a paso, restauramos la autoestima del alumno y convertimos cada pequeño logro en motivación genuina para ser autónomos.
        </p>

        <!-- 3 Métricas en tarjetas pill redondeadas -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-space-sm w-full pt-space-md">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-space-md bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-[2rem] shadow-sm text-center">
            <span class="font-headline-lg text-[32px] text-primary leading-none">10+</span>
            <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Años de experiencia</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-space-md bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-[2rem] shadow-sm text-center">
            <span class="font-headline-lg text-[32px] text-secondary leading-none">98%</span>
            <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Tasa de éxito y aprobación</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-space-md bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-[2rem] shadow-sm text-center">
            <span class="font-headline-lg text-[32px] text-tertiary leading-none">1 a 1</span>
            <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Enfoque totalmente individual</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna derecha: Tarjeta grande rounded-3xl con fondo cálido suave -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-[2.5rem] p-space-xl lg:p-space-2xl shadow-[0_10px_32px_-6px_rgba(36,33,30,0.06)] flex flex-col justify-between gap-space-lg relative overflow-hidden">
          <!-- Ambient gentle background shape -->
          <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-48 h-48 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed/30 blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed/50 flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">psychology</span>
            </div>
            <span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Filosofía pedagógica</span>
          </div>

          <blockquote class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface font-normal italic leading-snug">
            “Cada mente aprende distinto, el secreto está en encontrar la llave adecuada.”
          </blockquote>

          <!-- SVG Illustration / Diagram with Peach and Sage tones -->
          <div class="w-full bg-surface-container-low/70 rounded-[2rem] p-space-lg flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
              <span>Ruta adaptativa de aprendizaje</span>
              <span class="text-secondary font-semibold">100% personalizada</span>
            </div>

            <svg class="w-full h-14 overflow-visible text-secondary" viewBox="0 0 340 70">
              <path
                d="M 10,50 Q 85,15 170,45 T 330,20"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-dasharray="2 0"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-width="3"
              ></path>
              <!-- Node 1: Diagnóstico -->
              <circle class="fill-primary" cx="10" cy="50" r="7"></circle>
              <!-- Node 2: Confianza -->
              <circle class="fill-tertiary-fixed-dim" cx="170" cy="45" r="7"></circle>
              <!-- Node 3: Éxito -->
              <circle class="fill-secondary" cx="330" cy="20" r="8"></circle>
            </svg>

            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-label-sm text-on-surface-variant/80 pt-1">
              <span>1. Diagnóstico</span>
              <span>2. Confianza &amp; Hábito</span>
              <span>3. Autonomía total</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm pt-space-2xs">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">verified</span> Plan pedagógico auditado
            </span>
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant/40">•</span>
            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Sin prisas, con rigor</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

